       signal than one in a colour that appears nowhere else, so the same alpha
       reads as roughly twice the light. */
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%, rgb(198 241 0 / 0.20) 0%, rgb(198 241 0 / 0.09) 38%, rgb(198 241 0 / 0) 70%);
