     was actually clipped — measured 19x22 with the full viewBox visible — but
     it reads as clipped, which is the same problem from the reader's side.
     Lucas: *"het logo naast de test sample pop-up is niet juist en afgeknipt
     lijkt het wel."* A mark needs to clear the radius that frames it. */
  .convbar .cb-logo { height: 24px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
